      "content": "it's not just about mistakes though. the timing is too specific. it feels like they're trying to squeeze me until I just give up and close the account myself. calling customer service just lets them see that i'm onto them. isn't there a way to move my money or set up some kind of buffer so they can't freeze me out or hit me with more of these \"technical errors\" while im trying to stay afloat?",
