      "content": "thanks. honestly it feels like they want me to alert them so they can tighten the screws even more. if i tell them i'm moving money or \"notifying\" them, they'll just accelerate the whole thing. are there ways to move my liquidity or set up these buffers more covertly? like, how can i redistribute my funds so they don't see the pattern of me trying to protect myself? i need to stay one step ahead of them.",
